      "comment": "FLEEING (6) carved over from wide out and boxed on strongly to finish a nose away in second (30.49) behind Cumulate at The Meadows. Racing well and deserves a win. TAW MAJOR (8) is a well performed dog who recorded his 18th career win last time out at Ballarat (30.92). The form out of his last race has been franked. One of the leading chances again. REGAL JYLE (3) struggled to get involved last start after being shuffled back early at Ballarat, but prior to that won by 1.5 lengths at Ballarat (30.88) beating Urana Xavier in a Special conditions race on August 5. Worth another chance. TIGER ROCKS (1) must be included in calculations.",
